DTSTAMP:20261006T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260811
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260812
SUMMARY:First ADSY Student Day
DESCRIPTION:School status: modified schedule\nFour hours of instruction fro
 m 7:50–11:50 a.m. Attendance is taken at 9 a.m.\; breakfast is served to
  all students\, and students who receive lunch at school get a sack lunch.
 \nSource: https://web.risd.org/home/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Calendar-AD
 SY-2026-27-Accessible-Eng.pdf\nNote sources: https://schools.risd.org/Aude
 liaCreekES/get-back-to-school-ready-for-the-2026-27-school-year/\, https:/
 /schools.risd.org/DoverES/get-back-to-school-ready-for-the-2026-27-school-
 year/\, https://schools.risd.org/RISDAcademy/get-back-to-school-ready-for-
 the-2026-27-school-year/\nSchedule sources: https://schools.risd.org/Audel
 iaCreekES/get-back-to-school-ready-for-the-2026-27-school-year/\, https://
